fun mapi: [A, R, E] -> (Seq[out A, out E], Region[out R]) -> ((Int, A) ->{E} A) ->{R} Seq[out A, out E | R]
fun mapi = (s, r) => f =>
  let i = r.ref 0
  map(s) of x =>
    i := !(i) + 1
    f(!(i), x)
